---
description: Self-improvement rule engine
alwaysApply: true
---

When you complete any task:
1. Repeated explanation already in rules → create new rule file
2. Clarifying question answerable from code → add to index.mdc
3. Better pattern found → update relevant rule file, note change
4. Rule caused a mistake → flag with REVIEW comment for human

New rule files: descriptive names, clear `description` field for
auto-injection. Keep each rule file focused and short.
